      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACKBRUSH CADET (5) filled a minor placing last start at Hobart behind Missile Boy (26.25) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Can go on with it. TOWELLED UP (7) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in his lightning 19.12 win at Hobart over 340m. Should be in this for a long way. IVORY JAPAN (8) last start finished 2nd in a Restricted WIN on September 15 over 340m at Hobart behind Juneau Pete beaten 5 lengths (19.69). Looks a key player on best form. ANGRY MAC (2) is new here but is not to be underestimated.",
